orus is itself a derivative of tesseract's `rus.traineddata`. Independently of
that, `tools/build_orusd.sh` decompiles 667 punctuation patterns and 222 number
patterns out of stock `rus.traineddata` with `dawg2wordlist` and recompiles
them against the orus unicharset.


